Hello All, I have perused several of the conversations relating to custom distributions and found them very useful for demonstrating how to expand the flexibility of nimble models. However, I haven't found an example that mimics the problems I have trying to make distributions from the 'extraDistr' package available to my nimble model. In particular, I would like to include the negative hypergeometric distribution in my model (rnhyper,dnhyper,qnhyper,pnhyper).   Any advice on how to implement distributions from other packages would be very helpful.    Thank you.

