Thanks all for the comments, I have concluded that it was an data availability issue. We did not have surveys during the period of interest in enough grid cells for the CAR to converge in a reasonable amount of time. Adjusting the sample size of the simulation seems to support this.

Again, thanks for the help, it was a good learning experience!
Matt

